      "licence": "MIT (data/external/datasets/dataset-psiloqa.md)",
      "fields": "wiki_passage -> chunk, question -> question, golden_answer -> claim; the validation and test splits are NOT read",
      "wall": "banked clean-mix corpus (DANN group `psiloqa`, in the mix since R8-H84); it predates the R14-H136 instrument, so this lane's census is its first 8-gram wall and it is run on the built artifacts"
    }
